# TorqueBus Studio — Quantized int8 Automotive Powertrain & Bus Anomaly Model
# Format: TBUSML 1
#
# Input features (6):
#   0: Vehicle speed (km/h)
#   1: Longitudinal acceleration (km/h/s)
#   2: Engine coolant temperature (degC)
#   3: Thermal deviation from nominal speed curve (degC)
#   4: CAN inter-frame arrival jitter ratio [0..2]
#   5: Bus / injected fault stress factor [0..1.5]
#
# Output dimensions (7):
#   0..4: Regime logits (Idle, Cruise, HighLoad, ThermalStress, Anomaly) -> Softmax
#   5   : Anomaly score logit -> Sigmoid * 100%
#   6   : Thermal health virtual sensor logit -> Sigmoid * 100%

